==Trivia==
*This stage is a reference to the Japanese television series ''[[wikipedia:Ultraman|Ultraman]]'' as the enemy base bears a resemblance to the main character of the series. Additionally, Ultraman is from [[wikia:ultra:Nebula M78|Nebula M78]], similar to the name of the stage.
**The [[Treasure]], 3 Minutes, is the same amount of time Ultraman can appear for in the show.
*Prior to [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]], a 300% [[Metal One Horn]] also appeared in Chapter 3.

